- **Market NE room, 122 m² sealed** (x 1002–1070, y 214–448) — the largest culled pocket: walled on all sides (thick wall x 1005–1013, diagonal Market wall case closing the south with its shelving teeth facing the *sales* floor), zero fixtures, zero labels. Back-of-house. Covered by `must_not [1040,300]`.
- **Every one of the 14 remaining unreachable non-fixture patches ≥2 m²** classified: checkout lanes ×3, behind-deli + its south notch, pharmacy, Market prep room, the two enclosed rooms east of the restrooms, both Cooking Connection demo-island interiors, the Market diagonal staff strip, and the three drafting slivers. No unexplained pocket remains.
- **Unanchored departments** (Market, Beer & Wine, Healthy Living, Cooking Connection, Sushiya Seafood, Tortilleria, Apparel, Books & Magazines, Tobacco) inspected individually against `geometry.json` — all have green frontage.
