- **Remaining graph-distance discontinuities** (deli-alley/cafe divider, deli-block U alcove, Tobacco bar, restroom-alcove north wall, customer-service office) all trace to walls or fixtures drawn in the PDF, not to our seals.
- **Config sanity:** 5 exclusions and 7 (now 10) inclusions each state a WHY that the drawing confirms; no inclusion blankets a staff room (`build_free` applies inclusions to `free_raw`, which already has exclusions removed, so the pharmacy cannot be reopened); no exclusion covers a shelf label's only frontage. `seal_zones.json` = the derived set plus one documented shape correction.
